//
// SmolVLA verify gate: end-to-end action-chunk regression, NPU SigLIP vision +
// connector against the unmodified lerobot CPU model, with fixed zero noise so
// the comparison is deterministic.
//
// SmolVLA emits a continuous action chunk rather than tokens, so this uses the
// regression gate from verify/comparators.py (cosine >= 0.99 AND normalized
// MSE <= 0.04) rather than the top-k token-set gate the autoregressive LLM
// siblings use.
//
// Needs the lerobot venv (torch + lerobot) with the mlir-air environment
// sourced, so that air/pyxrt are importable in the same process, plus the CPU
// baseline fixture — regenerate it with `make oracle` if it is absent.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, hf_token
//
// RUN: mkdir -p test_peano_verify
// RUN: cd test_peano_verify
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile verify PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: [verify] PASS
